 in the field of nutrition and dietetics by providing evidence analysis manuals and guidelines that inform dietary practices. The ADA offers comprehensive guidelines and positions on various aspects of nutrition, including dietary practices for older adults in long-term care settings, nutrition interventions for the treatment of eating disorders, and resources for managing specific conditions such as dysphagia. Additionally, the organization addresses the nutritional needs of patients with specific health conditions, including those with dementia, ensuring that dietitians and nutritionists have access to the necessary tools and information to support their clients effectively.", "Α-AMILASA SALIVAL:α-Amilasa salival is an enzyme that breaks down starches in the saliva, affecting the viscosity of thickened liquids and foods.", "PRODUCTOS COMERCIALES RTU:Ready-to-use commercial products are specially designed nutritional supplements for patients with dysphagia, providing modified consistency and texture.", "FLUIDOS ESPESADOS:Thickened fluids are liquids that have been modified in viscosity to assist individuals with dysphagia in swallowing safely.", "BRITO-DE LA FUENTE:Brito-de la Fuente et al. proposed considerations for designing RTU products for patients with dysphagia.", "SON:SON refers to chemically defined formulas designed for nutritional support in dysphagia patients.", "GOLD STANDARD:Videofluoroscopic swallowing studies (VFSS) are considered the gold standard for evaluating swallowing.", "INDUSTRY:The food industry has developed a wide range of products to ensure proper consistency for dysphagia patients.", "LIQUIDS OF CONTRAST:Contrast liquids based on barium sulfate are designed for different levels of dysphagia to evaluate swallowing safety and efficacy.", "DIET ADAPTATION:Diet adaptation is crucial for patients with dysphagia after diagnosis, focusing on texture, volume, and viscosity of liquids.", "TEXTURA:Texture is an important aspect of the diet for patients with dysphagia, influencing their ability to swallow safely."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}